                    Transitions are short, sharp, powerful — duration-150 or duration-200, always ease-out, never ease-in-out
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div className="p-8">
                <p className="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-black mb-6 opacity-50">
