              className="font-serif font-light text-xs tracking-widest mt-10 leading-loose"
              style={{ color: "rgba(44,44,44,0.3)" }}
            >
              This space is not empty.<br />
              It breathes. It waits. It means.
            </p>
          </RevealBlock>
        </div>
      </section>

