- Pure Black: #000000 (all text, borders)
- Pure White: #ffffff (all backgrounds)
- System Silver: #dfdfdf (button backgrounds)
- System Gray: #808080 (border shadow side)
- Link Blue: #0000ff (hyperlinks)
